  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterHarbor2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Aby! I was waiting for you, love!~
  - "Uh, stop it. After today\u2019s mission\u2026 it all happens. Aren\u2019t you
    scared?"
  - "I am. But just so you know, we\u2019ve spent months dealing with terrorists
    every day. The escape plan sounds safer than staying here."
  - "Well\u2026 yes, but still. Terrorists are routine at this point. Most of them
    are poor, uneducated idiots desperate for money. Every group follows patterns."
  - And how exactly does that make them safer than escaping?
  - "Getting shot by one of them would be ordinary. Every day here feels the same.
    You stop expecting a future. But now, when freedom is one step away\u2026 dying
    would just be disappointing."
  - "Yeah, but imagine the relief once we cross the border. You\u2019ve suffered
    your whole life. Maybe it\u2019s finally time to rest."
  - "And after we cross, hell still might not end. We\u2019ll have no money, no jobs,
    no past, no idea where we are. And don\u2019t say something disgusting like \u201CBut
    we\u2019ll all have each other.\u201D I hate that."
  - "Don\u2019t worry, I wasn\u2019t going to. I\u2019m not denying it\u2019ll be
    hard. But just imagine living without a constant threat to your life. Yeah, there\u2019ll
    be problems, but normal ones."
  - Not like here. Imagine washing your face without worrying about a call coming
    in at the worst moment.
  - "Sleeping properly, ha, with me of course. Waking up somewhere that isn\u2019t
    surrounded by factories. Beast said his family has a house on the outskirts."
  - "Weird hearing someone talk about peace when he\u2019s a pyromaniac\u2026"
  - "I told you already \u2014 they labeled me a pyromaniac because I blew up a base
    and a warehouse during a protest\u2026"
  - "Yeah, honestly that\u2019s almost cute. Just don\u2019t blow up Beast\u2019s
    precious wood stove he keeps talking about\u2026 haha\u2026 "
  - Or maybe it was pyromania that brought me to you?..
  - "Ewwww\u2026\u2026."
